 "text": "Bonjour!  <br><br>I love Parisian breakfasts! Today, I found a little cafe by my hotel. I had an incredible view of the Eiffel Tower. Lisette, the owner was so friendly.  I spoke to her about the cafe and her menu. She said she only chooses quality ingredients. The eggs arrive daily from an organic farm outside of Paris. The owner said she prepares all of the things on the menu herself. She bakes her own bread every morning and makes her own strawberry jam. My pancakes, eggs and toast were delicious. Lisette offered to show me how to bake traditional French bread. We are going to meet up later in the week.", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn4le01ob04re2img01.jpg", "time": "51000", "text": "She asked me, \u201cWhere are you staying in this beautiful city?\u201d When I told her Hotel Margot, Lisette said there is a bakery in that neighborhood. It has fantastic chocolate croissants and cake. I'm going to give it a try!", "id": 2}], "audiosrc": "engenn4le01ob04re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn4le01ob04re2img02.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1, "title": "", "id": 1}]}]}